            "paragraph": "The data sources include Sentinel-2 Surface Reflectance imagery for high-resolution vegetation indices, MODIS Surface Reflectance products for temporal gap-filling, ERA5-Land reanalysis for meteorological variables, and VIIRS active fire detections for fire occurrence labeling.",
